      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Mixing hydrocodone with benzadryl is dangerous and could lead to severe respiratory depression because both substances depress the central nervous system. This combination should not be done without the explicit approval of your prescribing physician or pharmacist, as it significantly increases the risk of overdose, extreme drowsiness, and life-threatening breathing issues. For safer sleep management, please consult your doctor immediately before adding any over-the-counter sleep aids to your current pain medication regimen.",
