    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i already talked to my doc about the pain and they just told me to keep taking the hydro. they didn't really say anything about sleep. i'm just looking for something to help me drift off so i'm not staring at the ceiling all night. like, is it really that bad if i just take a small dose of the benadryl? just like half a pill or something? it feels like a pretty minor thing.",
